      "text": "### Resolve refund manually\n\nThe automatic refund failed (missing IBAN, expired card or payment provider not reachable). **Return** {{returnId}} · **order** {{orderId}} · **customer** {{customerEmail}}\n\nClarify with the customer or the payment provider and enter the reference of the refund or voucher.",
